{
  "title": "englishpod_C0075pb",
  "audio": "./assets/englishpod_C0075pb.mp3",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Hello everyone, welcome back to EnglishPod, my name is Marco.",
      "trans": "大家好，欢迎再次回到英语频道，我的名字叫马克。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm Erica.",
      "trans": "我是艾瑞克。",
      "start": 5.28,
      "end": 6.5200000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "And today we're going to be going to one of the least favorite places of many, many people.",
      "trans": "今天我们将要前往一个许多人不喜爱的地方。",
      "start": 6.5200000000000005,
      "end": 12.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So it must be the dentist.",
      "trans": "所以，它必须是牙医。",
      "start": 12.24,
      "end": 14.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 14.48,
      "end": 15.48
    },
    {
      "text": "That place where you have to go every six months, but you probably don't go.",
      "trans": "这个地方，你每六个月就要去的，但你可能并不经常去。",
      "start": 15.48,
      "end": 21.52
    },
    {
      "text": "You probably don't.",
      "trans": "您可能不会。",
      "start": 21.52,
      "end": 22.52
    },
    {
      "text": "I know I don't go every six months.",
      "trans": "我知道我并不经常去。",
      "start": 22.52,
      "end": 24.6
    },
    {
      "text": "So yeah, we're going to be going to the dentist.",
      "trans": "所以啊，我们打算去看牙医。",
      "start": 24.6,
      "end": 26.92
    },
    {
      "text": "And of course we're going to be looking at a lot of great vocabulary related to teeth",
      "trans": "当然，我们也会关注许多与牙齿相关的优美词汇。",
      "start": 26.92,
      "end": 31.68
    },
    {
      "text": "and all that crazy stuff dentists do.",
      "trans": "和那些疯狂的牙医做的一切。",
      "start": 31.68,
      "end": 34.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 34.52,
      "end": 35.52
    },
    {
      "text": "And we'll also learn some really interesting phrases.",
      "trans": "而且我们还将学习一些非常有趣的话语。",
      "start": 35.52,
      "end": 37.88
    },
    {
      "text": "So Marco, let's get started with our vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "所以马科，让我们开始我们的词汇预览。",
      "start": 37.88,
      "end": 42.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "词汇预览。",
      "start": 42.64,
      "end": 43.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, and vocabulary preview today we have two words.",
      "trans": "好的，今天词汇预览我们有两个词。",
      "start": 43.64,
      "end": 47.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's take a look at the first one.",
      "trans": "请看第一个。",
      "start": 47.52,
      "end": 49.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Toothache.",
      "trans": "牙痛。",
      "start": 49.52,
      "end": 50.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Toothache.",
      "trans": "牙痛。",
      "start": 50.52,
      "end": 51.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Toothache.",
      "trans": "牙痛。",
      "start": 51.52,
      "end": 52.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Toothache.",
      "trans": "牙痛。",
      "start": 52.52,
      "end": 53.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so we've seen before this, uh,",
      "trans": "好的，我们之前也见过这个，嗯。",
      "start": 53.52,
      "end": 56.480000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "this ending ache, right?",
      "trans": "这个结尾痛，对吗？",
      "start": 57.279999999999994,
      "end": 58.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 58.76,
      "end": 59.76
    },
    {
      "text": "It means it hurts.",
      "trans": "这句话意味着它伤害了。",
      "start": 59.76,
      "end": 60.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 60.76,
      "end": 61.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So again, a toothache would be a hurting tooth.",
      "trans": "所以，再次，一个牙痛就是一颗痛牙。",
      "start": 61.76,
      "end": 63.76
    },
    {
      "text": "A hurting tooth.",
      "trans": "一个疼痛的牙齿。",
      "start": 63.76,
      "end": 64.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 64.75999999999999,
      "end": 65.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "We can also say stomach ache.",
      "trans": "我们还可以说胃痛。",
      "start": 65.75999999999999,
      "end": 66.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Headache.",
      "trans": "头痛。",
      "start": 66.75999999999999,
      "end": 67.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 67.75999999999999,
      "end": 68.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Pretty much everything can ache.",
      "trans": "基本上一切都能做到。",
      "start": 68.75999999999999,
      "end": 70.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 70.75999999999999,
      "end": 71.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So our next word X-ray.",
      "trans": "所以我们的下一个字是X射线。",
      "start": 71.75999999999999,
      "end": 74.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "X-ray.",
      "trans": "X-ray in Chinese is \"射线\" (shā yà).",
      "start": 74.75999999999999,
      "end": 75.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "X-ray.",
      "trans": "X-ray in Chinese is \"射线\" (shā yà).",
      "start": 75.75999999999999,
      "end": 76.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "X- hyphen.",
      "trans": "X- 希腊字母。",
      "start": 76.75999999999999,
      "end": 77.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "R-A-Y.",
      "trans": "[Conn Error]",
      "start": 77.75999999999999,
      "end": 78.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, a pretty easy word.",
      "trans": "好的，一个比较容易的词。",
      "start": 78.75999999999999,
      "end": 81.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you go to the doctor, many times you'll get an X-ray.",
      "trans": "所以当你去医院看病时，你常常会得到X光检查。",
      "start": 81.28,
      "end": 85.6
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a picture of your bones.",
      "trans": "这是一个你的骨骼的图片。",
      "start": 85.6,
      "end": 88.39999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 88.39999999999999,
      "end": 89.39999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's an X-ray.",
      "trans": "所以，这就是X光。",
      "start": 89.39999999999999,
      "end": 91.39999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, well, we're going to hear both of these words in the dialogue.",
      "trans": "好的，很好，我们将在这对话中听到这两个词。",
      "start": 91.39999999999999,
      "end": 95.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't we listen as Gary visits his dentist?",
      "trans": "所以为什么我们不听他去看牙医呢？",
      "start": 95.28,
      "end": 99.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, Gary.",
      "trans": "你好，张伟。",
      "start": 110.08,
      "end": 112.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Great to see you again.",
      "trans": "你好，再次见到你。",
      "start": 112.36,
      "end": 115.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Please have a seat.",
      "trans": "请坐。",
      "start": 115.08,
      "end": 117.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So tell me what seems to be the problem.",
      "trans": "所以告诉我这个问题是什么。",
      "start": 117.67999999999999,
      "end": 122.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks, Doc.",
      "trans": "谢谢，医生。",
      "start": 122.56,
      "end": 123.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I've got a really bad toothache.",
      "trans": "我牙疼的很严重。",
      "start": 123.56,
      "end": 126.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't eat anything and look.",
      "trans": "我不能吃任何东西，也不看。",
      "start": 126.32,
      "end": 128.0
    },
    {
      "text": "My face is all swollen.",
      "trans": "我的脸肿得像被压扁了似的。",
      "start": 128.0,
      "end": 129.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it might be my wisdom teeth.",
      "trans": "我认为我的智齿可能有点问题。",
      "start": 129.88,
      "end": 132.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, let's have a look.",
      "trans": "很好，让我们看看。",
      "start": 132.32,
      "end": 136.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Open wide.",
      "trans": "打开大些。",
      "start": 136.56,
      "end": 138.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "trans": "嗯，哈。",
      "start": 138.56,
      "end": 139.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Hmm, this doesn't look good.",
      "trans": "嗯，这看起来不太好。",
      "start": 146.08,
      "end": 150.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, it looks like you have a cavity and your crown is loose.",
      "trans": "嗯，看来你有牙齿蛀洞，你的牙冠松动。",
      "start": 150.08,
      "end": 156.32000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll need to put in a filling before it gets any worse.",
      "trans": "我们得先填好，不然会更糟。",
      "start": 156.32000000000002,
      "end": 160.32000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "And the crown probably needs to be refitted.",
      "trans": "和皇冠需要进行重新组装。",
      "start": 160.32000000000002,
      "end": 164.48000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to order some X-rays.",
      "trans": "我打算买一些X光。",
      "start": 164.48000000000002,
      "end": 169.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it going to hurt?",
      "trans": "是会痛吗？",
      "start": 169.0,
      "end": 170.32000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "No, not at all.",
      "trans": "是的，不。",
      "start": 170.32000000000002,
      "end": 173.88000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Just lay back and relax.",
      "trans": "请坐，好好休息。",
      "start": 173.88,
      "end": 180.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "对不起，我无法直接翻译中文到中文。不过，我可以尝试用英文来回答你的问题。",
      "start": 180.88,
      "end": 183.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "对不起！",
      "start": 183.88,
      "end": 187.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "啊！",
      "start": 187.88,
      "end": 191.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "你好！",
      "start": 191.88,
      "end": 192.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "啊！",
      "start": 192.88,
      "end": 193.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "对不起！",
      "start": 193.88,
      "end": 194.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "你好！",
      "start": 194.88,
      "end": 195.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "你好！",
      "start": 195.88,
      "end": 196.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "trans": "你好！",
      "start": 196.88,
      "end": 197.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, spit.",
      "trans": "好的，吐。",
      "start": 197.88,
      "end": 198.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, that always happens.",
      "trans": "好的，那总是会发生的。",
      "start": 198.88,
      "end": 199.88
    },
    {
      "text": "The dentist says, no, it's not going to hurt.",
      "trans": "牙医说，不，它不会痛。",
      "start": 199.88,
      "end": 201.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't worry about it.",
      "trans": "不要担心。",
      "start": 201.88,
      "end": 202.88
    },
    {
      "text": "It always hurts much more than he says.",
      "trans": "它总是比他说的更痛。",
      "start": 202.88,
      "end": 205.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 205.88,
      "end": 206.88
    },
    {
      "text": "So in this dialogue, we saw some interesting words when the dentist was describing what problems",
      "trans": "所以在这次对话中，我们看到了一些有趣的词汇，当牙医描述了哪些问题时。",
      "start": 206.88,
      "end": 212.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Gary had.",
      "trans": "Gary已经。",
      "start": 212.0,
      "end": 213.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 213.0,
      "end": 214.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't we look at those now in language takeaway?",
      "trans": "所以为什么不把这些放在语言小站里呢？",
      "start": 214.0,
      "end": 218.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Language takeaway.",
      "trans": "语言小贴士。",
      "start": 218.56,
      "end": 219.56
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, let's take a look at our first word.",
      "trans": "好的，让我们来看看我们的第一个单词。",
      "start": 219.56,
      "end": 223.07999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "So Gary said that his face was all swollen.",
      "trans": "所以Gary说他的脸肿了。",
      "start": 223.07999999999998,
      "end": 228.35999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Swollen.",
      "trans": "胀大。",
      "start": 228.35999999999999,
      "end": 229.35999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Swollen.",
      "trans": "胀大。",
      "start": 229.35999999999999,
      "end": 230.35999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Swollen.",
      "trans": "胀大。",
      "start": 230.35999999999999,
      "end": 231.35999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So swollen is an adjective, right Marco?",
      "trans": "所以形容词很肿，Marco？",
      "start": 231.68,
      "end": 234.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 234.68,
      "end": 235.68
    },
    {
      "text": "So his face is or was swollen.",
      "trans": "所以他的脸是或曾经是肿的。",
      "start": 235.68,
      "end": 239.56
    },
    {
      "text": "It was bigger.",
      "trans": "它是更大的。",
      "start": 239.56,
      "end": 240.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, his face was bigger than normal.",
      "trans": "是的，他的脸比正常人更大。",
      "start": 240.56,
      "end": 242.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 242.68,
      "end": 243.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Often when you hurt yourself, that part of your body becomes swollen.",
      "trans": "经常当你受伤时，受伤的部分会肿胀。",
      "start": 243.68,
      "end": 247.72000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Swollen, right?",
      "trans": "胀大了？",
      "start": 247.72000000000003,
      "end": 248.72000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "So you have to put some ice on it usually and then the swelling will go down.",
      "trans": "所以你通常需要在上面放一些冰，然后肿胀就会减轻。",
      "start": 248.72000000000003,
      "end": 252.88000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "And that's the noun, the swelling.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“那只是名词，膨胀。”",
      "start": 252.88000000000002,
      "end": 255.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 255.08,
      "end": 256.08000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "The swelling.",
      "trans": "水肿。",
      "start": 256.08000000000004,
      "end": 257.08000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, the verb too swell.",
      "trans": "好的，这个句子在中文中可以翻译为：",
      "start": 257.08000000000004,
      "end": 258.72
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, three words for the price of one.",
      "trans": "好的，三个词来表示价格的一元。",
      "start": 258.72,
      "end": 261.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's listen to some examples of how we would use the swelling, swollen and to swell.",
      "trans": "所以，让我们听听我们如何使用“肿胀”、“肿胀”和“肿胀”。",
      "start": 261.32,
      "end": 268.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Example one.",
      "trans": "Example one. 例一。",
      "start": 268.8,
      "end": 271.4
    },
    {
      "text": "My nose is swollen.",
      "trans": "我的鼻子肿了。",
      "start": 271.4,
      "end": 272.8
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the size of a football.",
      "trans": "它是足球的大小。",
      "start": 272.8,
      "end": 276.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Example two.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 276.96,
      "end": 279.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Put some ice on your foot and the swelling will go down.",
      "trans": "请将你的脚放在冰块上，肿胀就会减轻。",
      "start": 279.4,
      "end": 284.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Example three.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 284.88,
      "end": 287.15999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "I got bitten by a spider and my hand is swelling up.",
      "trans": "我被一只蜘蛛咬伤了，我的手肿胀起来了。",
      "start": 287.16,
      "end": 291.48
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 291.48,
      "end": 292.96000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "So Gary's face was swollen and he thought that it was his wisdom teeth.",
      "trans": "所以张的脸上肿了，他觉得这是他的智齿。",
      "start": 292.96000000000004,
      "end": 298.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Wisdom teeth.",
      "trans": "智慧牙。",
      "start": 298.40000000000003,
      "end": 299.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Wisdom teeth.",
      "trans": "智慧牙。",
      "start": 299.40000000000003,
      "end": 300.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so this is interesting.",
      "trans": "好的，这是有趣的。",
      "start": 300.40000000000003,
      "end": 302.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Wisdom is like wise.",
      "trans": "智慧就像智慧。",
      "start": 302.24,
      "end": 303.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, knowledge.",
      "trans": "是的，知识。",
      "start": 303.64000000000004,
      "end": 304.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Knowledge.",
      "trans": "知识 (zhì jī) in Chinese is \"知识\" (zhì jī).",
      "start": 304.64000000000004,
      "end": 305.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 305.64000000000004,
      "end": 306.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "So these teeth, they're not knowledgeable, but they're called wisdom teeth.",
      "trans": "所以这些牙齿，它们不是知识渊博的，而是被称为智齿。",
      "start": 306.64000000000004,
      "end": 310.04
    },
    {
      "text": "They're the teeth that grow last in your mouth, right?",
      "trans": "他们就是你口腔里最后长出的牙齿，对吗？",
      "start": 310.04,
      "end": 312.44000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 312.44000000000005,
      "end": 313.44000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "They are the last teeth at the very end of your mouth.",
      "trans": "他们是最后一颗在你嘴里最末端的牙齿。",
      "start": 313.44000000000005,
      "end": 316.52000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, and usually you get them when you're about 20.",
