      "text": "Let's have a look.",
      "trans": "让我们看看。",
      "start": 585.8000000000001,
      "end": 586.8000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's look at it and see what the problem is.",
      "trans": "让我们看看问题是什么。",
      "start": 586.8000000000001,
      "end": 589.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "trans": "你好。",
      "start": 589.2,
      "end": 590.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 590.2,
      "end": 591.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's have a look.",
      "trans": "让我们看看。",
      "start": 591.2,
      "end": 592.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 592.2,
      "end": 593.2
    },
    {
      "text": "And our final phrase.",
      "trans": "我们的最后一句话。",
      "start": 593.2,
      "end": 594.48
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't look good.",
      "trans": "它看起来不好。",
      "start": 594.48,
      "end": 596.32
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't look good.",
      "trans": "它看起来不好。",
      "start": 596.32,
      "end": 597.96
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't look good.",
      "trans": "它看起来不好。",
      "start": 597.96,
      "end": 599.7600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So I can use this phrase for an object, right?",
      "trans": "所以，我可以用这句话作为对象使用吗？",
      "start": 599.7600000000001,
      "end": 601.8800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 601.8800000000001,
      "end": 602.8800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Like, this house doesn't look good.",
      "trans": "像，这个房子看起来不好。",
      "start": 602.8800000000001,
      "end": 604.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 604.68,
      "end": 605.68
    },
    {
      "text": "But here it's used a little bit differently.",
      "trans": "但是在这里稍微有所不同。",
      "start": 605.68,
      "end": 607.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't we listen to some examples to help us understand the meaning?",
      "trans": "所以为什么我们不听听一些例子来帮助我们理解含义？",
      "start": 607.52,
      "end": 613.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 1.",
      "trans": "示例 1。",
      "start": 613.16,
      "end": 616.4
    },
    {
      "text": "John told me it doesn't look good for me.",
      "trans": "约翰告诉我，我对这个不满意。",
      "start": 616.4,
      "end": 618.1999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I probably won't get the job.",
      "trans": "我可能不会得到这份工作。",
      "start": 618.1999999999999,
      "end": 623.3199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 2.",
      "trans": "Example 2. (注释：请将此翻译内容复制粘贴到聊天框中，以便我能够进行中文转文字的功能。)",
      "start": 623.3199999999999,
      "end": 626.12
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't look good for Michael Jackson.",
      "trans": "它看起来不太好，迈克尔·杰克逊。",
      "start": 626.12,
      "end": 628.0799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "He's in a lot of debt.",
      "trans": "他有很多债务。",
      "start": 628.0799999999999,
      "end": 632.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Michael 3.",
      "trans": "对不起，我无法直接翻译中文文本。但是，根据您提供的信息，\"Michael 3.\" 这句话可能是指某个特定的数字或代码。如果您能提供更多的上下文或者具体的语言背景，我将能够更好地帮助您进行翻译。例如：",
      "start": 632.4,
      "end": 635.68
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, the economy doesn't look very good.",
      "trans": "我知道，经济状况不太好。",
      "start": 635.68,
      "end": 639.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 639.24,
      "end": 640.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So in the examples, we can see that they are using it for the situation.",
      "trans": "所以，在例子中，我们可以看到他们正在用它来应对情况。",
      "start": 640.56,
      "end": 644.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 644.0,
      "end": 645.0
    },
    {
      "text": "It looks maybe problematic.",
      "trans": "它可能有点问题。",
      "start": 645.0,
      "end": 646.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 646.84,
      "end": 647.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you say it doesn't look good, you basically mean there are going to be problems.",
      "trans": "所以当你说它不好看时，基本上意味着会有一些问题。",
      "start": 647.84,
      "end": 653.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "trans": "你好。",
      "start": 653.64,
      "end": 654.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 654.64,
      "end": 655.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't look good.",
      "trans": "它看起来不好。",
      "start": 655.64,
      "end": 656.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 656.64,
      "end": 657.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 657.64,
      "end": 658.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So great phrases, great words.",
      "trans": "所以美好的词汇，美好的语言。",
      "start": 658.64,
      "end": 660.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Just listen to our Gary at the dentist one more time.",
      "trans": "请听一下我们的Gary在牙医那里再重复一次。",
      "start": 660.64,
      "end": 664.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we'll come back and talk a little bit more.",
      "trans": "然后我们将回来聊点更多。",
      "start": 664.84,
      "end": 667.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, Gary.",
      "trans": "你好，张伟。",
      "start": 667.64,
      "end": 675.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Great to see you again.",
      "trans": "你好，再次见到你。",
      "start": 675.64,
      "end": 678.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Please have a seat.",
      "trans": "请坐。",
      "start": 678.72,
      "end": 681.48
    },
    {
      "text": "So tell me what seems to be the problem.",
      "trans": "所以告诉我这个问题是什么。",
      "start": 681.48,
      "end": 686.4399999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks, Doc.",
      "trans": "谢谢，医生。",
      "start": 686.4399999999999,
      "end": 687.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I've got a really bad toothache.",
      "trans": "我牙疼得非常厉害。",
      "start": 687.76,
      "end": 690.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't eat anything and look, my face is all swollen.",
      "trans": "我不能吃任何东西，看，我的脸肿得像一个大胖子。",
      "start": 690.04,
      "end": 693.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it might be my wisdom teeth.",
      "trans": "我认为我的智齿可能有点问题。",
      "start": 693.64,
      "end": 696.3199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, let's have a look.",
      "trans": "好的，让我们看看。",
      "start": 696.3199999999999,
      "end": 700.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Open wide.",
      "trans": "打开大些。",
      "start": 700.56,
      "end": 705.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "trans": "你好。",
      "start": 705.16,
      "end": 711.4399999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "This doesn't look good.",
      "trans": "这看起来不好。",
      "start": 711.4399999999999,
      "end": 713.5999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, it looks like you have a cavity and your crown is loose.",
      "trans": "嗯，看起来你可能有牙齿蛀洞，你的牙冠松动。",
      "start": 713.5999999999999,
      "end": 719.4399999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll need to put in a filling before it gets any worse.",
      "trans": "我们得先填好，不然会更糟。",
      "start": 719.44,
      "end": 724.12
    },
    {
      "text": "And the crown probably needs to be refitted.",
      "trans": "和皇冠需要进行重新组装。",
      "start": 724.12,
      "end": 728.2800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to order some X-rays.",
      "trans": "我打算购买X光检查。",
      "start": 728.2800000000001,
      "end": 732.7600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it going to hurt?",
      "trans": "是会痛吗？",
      "start": 732.7600000000001,
      "end": 734.08
    },
    {
      "text": "No, not at all.",
      "trans": "是的，不。",
      "start": 734.08,
      "end": 737.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Just lay back and relax.",
      "trans": "请坐，好好放松。",
      "start": 737.6800000000001,
      "end": 741.6400000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, spit.",
      "trans": "好的，吐。",
      "start": 741.64,
      "end": 763.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, Marco, speaking of dentists, have you ever had an experience like this where you've",
      "trans": "嗯，马科，说到牙医，你有没有像这样经历过的体验呢？",
      "start": 763.88,
      "end": 769.92
    },
    {
      "text": "sped out a tooth at the dentist?",
      "trans": "请将 \"sped out a tooth at the dentist?\" 翻译成中文是：“拔牙时快出一颗牙齿。”",
      "start": 769.92,
      "end": 772.5999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, nothing so serious as this, but actually recently when I was in Cambodia, you called",
      "trans": "好的，不过这没什么大不了的，但最近我在柬埔寨的时候，你打电话了。",
      "start": 772.5999999999999,
      "end": 779.28
    },
    {
      "text": "us to in Cambodia.",
      "trans": "美国到柬埔寨。",
      "start": 779.28,
      "end": 781.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, our taxi driver offered us to have some local food and he said, well, we're going",
      "trans": "嗯，我们的出租车司机愿意给我们一些本地食物，并且他说，我们是去的。",
      "start": 781.8,
      "end": 787.4799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "to have dog.",
      "trans": "要养狗。",
      "start": 787.4799999999999,
      "end": 789.3199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So that was interesting.",
      "trans": "所以，那很有趣。",
      "start": 789.3199999999999,
      "end": 791.4799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Actually, it wasn't that bad.",
      "trans": "实际上，它并不算糟糕。",
      "start": 791.4799999999999,
      "end": 793.0799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "It was pretty good, but if you get around the fact that it's a dog.",
      "trans": "很好，但如果你绕过这个事实，它就不怎么样了。",
      "start": 793.0799999999999,
      "end": 796.68
    },
    {
      "text": "So what does this have to do with your teeth?",
      "trans": "所以，这与您的牙齿有什么关系？",
      "start": 796.68,
      "end": 798.16
    },
    {
      "text": "I was eating it and I bit a bone that was hidden and I chipped my tooth.",
      "trans": "我正吃着它，咬了一口隐藏的骨头，牙齿被刮伤了。",
      "start": 798.16,
      "end": 803.7199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So you broke part of your tooth?",
      "trans": "所以你破坏了你的牙齿的一部分？",
      "start": 803.7199999999999,
      "end": 805.1999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, like half of it, which I had already chipped before.",
      "trans": "是的，差不多一半，也就是我之前已经损坏了。",
      "start": 805.1999999999999,
      "end": 809.4399999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So I had to go to the dentist and so the dentist created a new crown with not with gold or",
      "trans": "所以我不得不去牙医那里，所以牙医制作了一个新的冠，而不是用黄金。",
      "start": 809.4399999999999,
      "end": 814.3199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "porcelain, actually with a paste.",
      "trans": "瓷器，实际上用粘土。",
      "start": 814.3199999999999,
      "end": 816.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh.",
      "trans": "哦。",
      "start": 816.4,
      "end": 817.4
    },
    {
      "text": "And then it becomes hard and it just looks normal.",
      "trans": "然后，它变得很难，而且看起来很正常。",
      "start": 817.4,
      "end": 819.28
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't even look like I have a fake crown, so to say.",
      "trans": "它甚至不像我有假冠，所以说。",
      "start": 819.28,
      "end": 823.3199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "But dentists can be really expensive.",
      "trans": "但是牙医的价格很高。",
      "start": 823.3199999999999,
      "end": 825.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So how much did this cost?",
      "trans": "所以，这个花了多少钱？",
      "start": 825.64,
      "end": 827.8399999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, this was for the bargain price of $10.",
      "trans": "正确答案是：很好，这是以低价$10的交易。",
      "start": 828.72,
      "end": 832.48
    },
    {
      "text": "$10?",
      "trans": "[Conn Error]",
      "start": 832.48,
      "end": 833.48
    },
    {
      "text": "$10.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"10\"可以翻译为：",
      "start": 833.48,
      "end": 834.48
    },
    {
      "text": "That's how much it cost.",
      "trans": "那有多贵。",
      "start": 834.48,
      "end": 835.8000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So we should all go to Cambodia for dentistry.",
      "trans": "所以，我们都应该去柬埔寨做牙医。",
      "start": 835.8000000000001,
      "end": 838.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, because actually, he was pretty good.",
      "trans": "是的，因为实际上他很好。",
      "start": 838.08,
      "end": 840.2800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "He looked really young though.",
      "trans": "他看起来很年轻。",
      "start": 840.2800000000001,
      "end": 841.2800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I was kind of scared because when he walked in, he looked like he was 19.",
      "trans": "我有点害怕，因为当他走进来时，他看起来好像只有19岁。",
      "start": 841.2800000000001,
      "end": 845.24
    },
    {
      "text": "But I asked him his age and he was like 30.",
      "trans": "但是，他问我他的年龄，他说他大约是三十岁。",
      "start": 845.24,
      "end": 847.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 847.52,
      "end": 848.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, you're very trusting.",
      "trans": "很好，你很信任。",
      "start": 848.52,
      "end": 849.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 849.52,
      "end": 850.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So I imagine that you guys maybe have some dental experiences, so why don't you come to",
      "trans": "所以我猜测你们可能也有口腔经历，所以为什么不来呢？",
      "start": 850.52,
      "end": 854.6
    },
    {
      "text": "our website and tell us all about it?",
      "trans": "我们的网站，你能告诉我们关于它吗？",
      "start": 854.6,
      "end": 856.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, visit us at EnglishPod.com and you can find lots more resources for learning English",
      "trans": "是的，可以访问我们的英语学习网站 www.englishpod.com，您将能够找到更多关于学习英语的信息。",
      "start": 856.36,
      "end": 863.48
    },
    {
      "text": "there.",
      "trans": "在这里。",
      "start": 863.48,
      "end": 864.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, guys, thanks for listening and until next time.",
      "trans": "好的，朋友们，谢谢你们倾听，下期再见。",
      "start": 864.48,
      "end": 867.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "trans": "拜。",
      "start": 867.08,
      "end": 868.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "trans": "再见。",
      "start": 868.08,
      "end": 869.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "trans": "拜。",
      "start": 869.08,
      "end": 870.08
    }
  ]
}